# The level warp from guest states other than gameplay
# (tests/harness/check_levelwarp.sh).
#
# One row per session. boot: the run's boot arguments. target: the level
# OPENPETE_LEVELWARP_TEST names. presses: VBLs at which Start is held for 6
# VBLs ("-": none). trigger: the openpete_frame at which the warp fires.
# at: the game state the trigger must find (the row is VACUOUS otherwise).
# limit: --frame-limit (VBLs). expect: refuse (no route; the game returns to
# gameplay with the demo word 0) or arrive (the warp lands in target).
#
# Fields, pipe-separated: name | boot | target | presses | trigger | at | limit | expect
artisans_paused | --skip-to-level artisans | dark_hollow | 2200,2800 | 2000 | 2 | 3600 | arrive
